## Hints for Future Agents
Fresh DFlash2 checkpoints must remain strict because all trainable convolution, selector, and backbone tensors are required. Other model families intentionally keep the pre-existing warning behavior in this PR.

## Codebase Discoveries
The converter applies the optional target embedding override only after load_state_dict. Therefore a global strict load conflicts with the documented legacy recovery path.

